              <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">
        If you no longer wish to receive these notifications, you can <a href="https://lagan.dev/unsubscribe?token=sample" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">unsubscribe here</a>.
